<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Payment Failed - Blue Sky Outsourcing</title>
    <style>
        body {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            font-family: 'Segoe UI', Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif;
            background-color: #f4f4f4;
        }
        .email-container {
            max-width: 600px;
            margin: 20px auto;
            background-color: #ffffff;
            border-radius: 8px;
            overflow: hidden;
            box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);
        }
        .header {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #667eea 0%, #764ba2 100%);
            padding: 30px 20px;
            text-align: center;
            color: #ffffff;
        }
        .header h1 {
            margin: 0;
            font-size: 24px;
            font-weight: 600;
        }
        .alert-icon {
            font-size: 48px;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
        }
        .content {
            padding: 40px 30px;
        }
        .greeting {
            font-size: 18px;
            color: #333333;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }
        .message {
            font-size: 16px;
            line-height: 1.6;
            color: #555555;
            margin-bottom: 25px;
        }
        .info-box {
            background-color: #fff3cd;
            border-left: 4px solid #ffc107;
            padding: 15px;
            margin: 25px 0;
            border-radius: 4px;
        }
        .info-box h3 {
            margin: 0 0 10px 0;
            color: #856404;
            font-size: 16px;
        }
        .info-row {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            padding: 8px 0;
            border-bottom: 1px solid #e0e0e0;
        }
        .info-row:last-child {
            border-bottom: none;
        }
        .info-label {
            font-weight: 600;
            color: #333333;
        }
        .info-value {
            color: #555555;
        }
        .cta-button {
            display: inline-block;
            padding: 15px 40px;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #667eea 0%, #764ba2 100%);
            color: #ffffff !important;
            text-decoration: none;
            border-radius: 6px;
            font-weight: 600;
            font-size: 16px;
            margin: 10px 5px;
            text-align: center;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 6px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);
            transition: transform 0.2s;
        }
        .cta-button:hover {
            transform: translateY(-2px);
            box-shadow: 0 6px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.15);
        }
        .secondary-button {
            display: inline-block;
            padding: 15px 40px;
            background-color: #ffffff;
            color: #667eea !important;
            text-decoration: none;
            border: 2px solid #667eea;
            border-radius: 6px;
            font-weight: 600;
            font-size: 16px;
            margin: 10px 5px;
            text-align: center;
        }
        .next-steps {
            background-color: #e3f2fd;
            border-left: 4px solid #2196f3;
            padding: 20px;
            margin: 25px 0;
            border-radius: 4px;
        }
        .next-steps h3 {
            margin: 0 0 15px 0;
            color: #1976d2;
            font-size: 16px;
        }
        .next-steps ul {
            margin: 0;
            padding-left: 20px;
        }
        .next-steps li {
            color: #555555;
            line-height: 1.8;
            margin-bottom: 8px;
        }
        .footer {
            background-color: #f8f9fa;
            padding: 20px;
            text-align: center;
            font-size: 14px;
            color: #777777;
        }
        .footer a {
            color: #667eea;
            text-decoration: none;
        }
        .divider {
            height: 1px;
            background-color: #e0e0e0;
            margin: 30px 0;
        }
        @media only screen and (max-width: 600px) {
            .content {
                padding: 30px 20px;
            }
            .cta-button, .secondary-button {
                display: block;
                margin: 10px 0;
            }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="email-container">
        <div class="header">
            <div class="alert-icon">⚠️</div>
            <h1>Payment Failed</h1>
        </div>
        
        <div class="content">
            <div class="greeting">Hi <%= name %>,</div>
            
            <div class="message">
                We tried to process your subscription payment but unfortunately it didn't go through.
            </div>
            
            <div class="info-box">
                <h3>Payment Details</h3>
                <div class="info-row">
                    <span class="info-label">Plan:</span>
                    <span class="info-value"><%= planName %></span>
                </div>
                <div class="info-row">
                    <span class="info-label">Amount:</span>
                    <span class="info-value"><%= currency %> <%= amount %></span>
                </div>
                <div class="info-row">
                    <span class="info-label">Reason:</span>
                    <span class="info-value"><%= failureReason %></span>
                </div>
            </div>
            
            <div class="message">
                <strong>Don't worry!</strong> We'll automatically try again on <strong><%= nextRetryDate %></strong>. 
                However, to ensure uninterrupted service, we recommend updating your payment method now.
            </div>
            
            <div style="text-align: center; margin: 30px 0;">
                <a href="<%= paymentLink %>" class="cta-button">Pay Now</a>
                <a href="<%= process.env.APP_URL %>/my-account/payment-methods" class="secondary-button">Update Payment Method</a>
            </div>
            
            <div class="next-steps">
                <h3>What Happens Next?</h3>
                <ul>
                    <li>Your subscription remains <strong>active</strong> during the grace period (6 days)</li>
                    <li>We'll automatically retry payment on <strong>Day 2, 4, and 6</strong></li>
                    <li>You can pay anytime using the "Pay Now" button above</li>
                    <li>If all retries fail, your subscription will be temporarily suspended</li>
                </ul>
            </div>
            
            <div class="divider"></div>
            
            <div class="message" style="font-size: 14px;">
                Need help? Our support team is here for you at 
                <a href="mailto:<%= supportEmail %>" style="color: #667eea;"><%= supportEmail %></a>
            </div>
        </div>
        
        <div class="footer">
            <p><strong>Blue Sky Outsourcing</strong></p>
            <p>© <%= new Date().getFullYear() %> Blue Sky Outsourcing. All rights reserved.</p>
            <p>
                <a href="<%= process.env.APP_URL %>">Visit Website</a> | 
                <a href="<%= process.env.APP_URL %>/contact">Contact Support</a>
            </p>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>

